  "raw_statement_html": "<td valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FAFBCA\" class=\"cell_0\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">В пирамиде <?xml:namespace prefix = m ns = \"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" /><m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mi>D</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> рёбра <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>A</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math>, <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> и <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> попарно перпендикулярны, а <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msqrt> <m:mn>2</m:mn> </m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">а) Докажите, что эта пирамида правильная.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">б) На рёбрах <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>A</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> и <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> отмечены точки <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mi>M</m:mi> </m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> и <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mi>N</m:mi> </m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> соответственно, причём <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>M</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo><m:mi>M</m:mi><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mi>N</m:mi><m:mo>:</m:mo><m:mi>N</m:mi><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>:</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math>. Найдите расстояние от точки <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mi>D</m:mi> </m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math> до плоскости <m:math><m:mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><m:semantics><m:mrow><m:mi>M</m:mi><m:mi>N</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi> </m:mrow></m:semantics></m:mstyle></m:math>.</p></td>",
  "statement_html": "<div><section> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">В пирамиде <?xml:namespace prefix = m ns = \"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math> рёбра <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math> и <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math> попарно перпендикулярны, а <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt></mrow></semantics></mstyle></math>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">а) Докажите, что эта пирамида правильная.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">б) На рёбрах <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math> и <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math> отмечены точки <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mi>M</mi> </semantics></mstyle></math> и <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mi>N</mi> </semantics></mstyle></math> соответственно, причём <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math>. Найдите расстояние от точки <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mi>D</mi> </semantics></mstyle></math> до плоскости <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi> </mrow></semantics></mstyle></math>.</p></section></div>",
